AArch64 lane-wpos-acquire
"the producer writes a record word (a) then stores wpos (b) with release; the consumer loads wpos with acquire, then the word"
{
0:X1=a; 0:X3=b;
1:X1=a; 1:X3=b;
}
 P0           | P1 ;
 MOV W0,#1    | LDAR W0,[X3] ;
 STR W0,[X1]  | LDR W2,[X1] ;
 MOV W2,#16   | ;
 STLR W2,[X3] | ;
exists (1:X0=16 /\ 1:X2=0)
